## Feng shui

cultivation-site-no-mat = You aren't sitting on a cultivation mat, so your surroundings barely matter.
cultivation-site-no-law = You have no law yet. The mat still helps you focus.
cultivation-site-element-strong = Strong {$element} influence nourishes your {$law}.
cultivation-site-element-some = Some {$element} influence. More would help your {$law}.
cultivation-site-element-none = No {$element} influence at all for your {$law}.
cultivation-site-element-fed = {CAPITALIZE($mother)} feeds {$element} here.
cultivation-site-element-suppressed = Heavy {$enemy} influence is suppressing your {$element} qi!
cultivation-site-secluded = You are secluded. Nobody is here to disturb you.
cultivation-site-crowded = Others are nearby. Closed-door seclusion would be better.
cultivation-mat-mortal = It's just a nice mat.
cultivation-mat-reading = You sense the flow of the five elements here: {$readout}. Sit on it and use Spiritual Sense for a full reading.

## Station qi

cultivation-station-qi-singularity = The singularity hums with overwhelming qi. Meditating near it would be very fast, and very dangerous.
cultivation-station-qi-lightning = A ball of heaven's lightning is close. Its qi is immense, and so is the danger.
cultivation-station-qi-fire = Wild fire qi blazes nearby. Meditating in it would be fast, and painful.
cultivation-station-qi-singularity-feed = The singularity's pull pours raw qi into you... and something else.
cultivation-station-qi-lightning-feed = Heaven's own lightning crackles around you, feeding your meridians.
cultivation-station-qi-fire-feed = You breathe in the fire's qi. It breathes back.

## Guqin

guqin-examine-cultivator = Playing it is a form of cultivation. You and every cultivator listening nearby slowly gain insight and calm your qi.
guqin-peace = Someone is playing the guqin beautifully. You feel at peace.
guqin-insight = The music stirs your qi, and you understand a little more.
guqin-meridians-settle = The music settles your torn meridians.
